        "kind": "markdown",
        "text": "## Lean\n\nAll other Lean is folded into one **Lean** line, because it matters to Lean, not to the reader. That includes imports (the folded line at the top), `instance` declarations, quick checks such as `example`, and LaTeX notation rules. This one gives points a default value, checks that doubling 3 gives 6, and tells the LaTeX view how to write `Basics.double`:",
