        "kind": "lean",
        "text": "instance : Inhabited Basics.Point := ⟨⟨0, 0⟩⟩\n\nexample : Basics.double 3 = 6 := rfl\n\nopen Lean LeanTeX in\nlatex_pp_app_rules (const := Basics.double)\n  | _, #[n] => do\n    let n ← latexPP n\n    return LatexData.atomString \"\\\\operatorname{double}\" ++ n.parens",
